00:05:41,052 --> 00:05:47,052
Don't fear the end of the world. Fear what happens next.

2
00:11:22,105 --> 00:11:28,105
Pandorum is a action, horror, mystery film directed by Christian Alvart.

3
00:17:03,157 --> 00:17:09,157
Two crew members wake up on an abandoned spacecraft with no idea who they
are, how long they've been asleep, or what their mission is.

4
00:22:44,210 --> 00:22:50,210
The two soon discover they're actually not alone – and the reality of their
situation is more horrifying than they could have imagined.

5
00:28:25,263 --> 00:28:31,263
Bower, played by Ben Foster.

6
00:34:06,315 --> 00:34:12,315
Payton, played by Dennis Quaid.

7
00:39:47,368 --> 00:39:53,368
Gallo, played by Cam Gigandet.

8
