Nadia, played by Antje Traue.

9
00:51:09,473 --> 00:51:15,473
Manh, played by Cung Le.

10
00:56:50,526 --> 00:56:56,526
Leland, played by Eddie Rouse.

11
01:02:31,578 --> 01:02:37,578
Pandorum is a 2009 science fiction horror film directed by Christian
Alvart, produced by Robert Kulzer, Jeremy Bolt and Paul W.

12
01:08:12,631 --> 01:08:18,631
Anderson (the latter two through their Impact Pictures
banner), and starring Dennis Quaid and Ben Foster.

13
01:13:53,684 --> 01:13:59,684
Travis Milloy wrote the screenplay from a story by Milloy and Alvart.

14
01:19:34,736 --> 01:19:40,736
The film's title is a fictional slang term for a form of psychosis caused by deep space and
triggered by emotional stress, leading to severe paranoia, delirium, and nosebleeds.

15
01:25:15,789 --> 01:25:21,789
Pandorum was released on 25 September 2009 in the United
States, and on 2 October 2009 in the UK.

16
01:30:56,842 --> 01:31:02,842
The film was poorly received and a box office flop.

17
01:36:37,894 --> 01:36:43,894
The film explores themes of spacecraft, mission, mutation, dystopia, survival.

18
01:42:18,947 --> 01:42:24,947
The tone is intense and dark and thought_provoking.
